{"availability":"available","full":"appsoftwareltd/etherpk-client","name":"etherpk-client","description":"The EtherPK client application ","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":8,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-24T10:54:24Z","updated":"2026-10-17T16:54:56Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://etherpk.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T06:16:31.767Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T06:16:31.767Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T06:16:31.767Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T18:18:56.501Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T18:18:56.501Z","stars":4,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T18:42:26.359Z","stars":6,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T19:33:21.488Z","stars":7,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-13T06:37:06.419Z","stars":7,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T06:16:31.767Z","stars":8,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The source of the EtherPK Client and Headless Client, available under the Elastic License 2.0.","Try the demo from etherpk.com. It runs in your browser, needs no account, and keeps what you write in that browser only.","EtherPK is a personal knowledge base in plain Markdown. Journal entries hold daily thinking, pages hold what outlives a day, and [[wikilinks]] tie them into a knowledge graph. The Client is the editor: a SvelteKit app that opens a graph from a folder on your computer, or from a Sync Server that stores graphs end-to-end encrypted and cannot read them. The Headless Client is the same engine without an editor: an MCP server that gives an AI agent one of your graphs."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/appsoftwareltd/etherpk-client/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3f1f7ebf163b10010d0819d6dcbd5450999c4c5902183bfe6401fb81de75fd57","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:05:12.664Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:05:12.664Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The source of the EtherPK Client and Headless C